    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1921140407",
      "Source": "When attached to a Chest Armor, the sulfur jetpack enables you to fly similar to Tek Armor's jetpack but with something new, your speed will be increased a bit!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"安装在胸甲上后，硫磺喷气背包能像泰克胸甲的喷气背包一样实现飞行，且有新特性 —— 速度会略微提升！","JA":""},
